{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-cycle","title":"绩效周期","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goal-setting-okr-alignment","title":"目标设定与 OKR 对齐","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/goal-setting-okr-alignment","wordCount":1902,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-review-writing","title":"绩效评估撰写","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/performance-review-writing","wordCount":1983,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"calibration-fairness","title":"校准与公平性","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/calibration-fairness","wordCount":2019,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 绩效周期\n\n绩效周期是将日常反馈转化为组织决策的制度化流程。本章覆盖绩效周期的三个核心环节：目标设定与 OKR 对齐（定义\"好\"的标准）、绩效评估撰写（记录与评价表现）、以及校准与公平性（确保评价的一致性与公正性）。\n\n从设定清晰目标到撰写有说服力的评估、再到通过校准会议消除偏差，三篇文档构成一个完整的绩效周期操作手册。本章内容直接决定团队成员的薪酬、晋升与发展资源分配，是管理者最需要严谨对待的制度性工作。\n"}